@base = http://localhost:3000

### Trang tĩnh (xem header X-Course trong response)
GET {{base}}/

### File CSS tĩnh
GET {{base}}/css/style.css

### requestTime
GET {{base}}/time

### requestCounter
GET {{base}}/stats

### Không có API key -> 401
GET {{base}}/admin/dashboard

### Sai API key -> 401
GET {{base}}/admin/dashboard
x-api-key: hacker

### Đúng API key -> 200
GET {{base}}/admin/dashboard
x-api-key: sdn302-secret
